      "source": "Options applicable to MongoDB <a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/manual/changeStreams/\">Change Streams</a>. Intended\nto be used along with <a href=\"messaging/ChangeStreamRequest.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>ChangeStreamRequest</code></a> in a sync world as\nwell <a href=\"ReactiveMongoOperations.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>ReactiveMongoOperations</code></a> if you prefer it that way.",
      "translation": "适用于 MongoDB<a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/manual/changeStreams/\">变更流</a>的选项。旨在与 <a href=\"messaging/ChangeStreamRequest.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>ChangeStreamRequest</code></a> 在同步环境中配合使用，同时也适用于如果您更倾向于该方式的<a href=\"ReactiveMongoOperations.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>ReactiveMongoOperations</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain a shiny new <a href=\"ChangeStreamOptions.ChangeStreamOptionsBuilder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>ChangeStreamOptions.ChangeStreamOptionsBuilder</code></a> and start defining options in this fancy fluent way. Just\ndon't forget to call <a href=\"ChangeStreamOptions.ChangeStreamOptionsBuilder.html#build()\"><code>build()</code></a> when done.",
